      "description": "Zeroes +$72/+$76(a6). While $FF1985 != 1 and +$8E(a5) != 0, drains +$8E(a6) by 4 (clamped >= 0) and toggles Ali +$36(a5) bit 1 via $FF1971 bit 0. Once $FF1985 == 1 or +$8E(a5) == 0, clears +$36:1 and +$38:2,6 on Ali, restores +$06(a5) = $FF0D7E, resets Ali State 0 / Anim 0 / Facing 2 / +$82 = $0A, snaps Ali X/Y to Shade with +$10(a5)=0, probes 0x009D00 on Ali, calls 0x01378A, enters State $0E, clears $FF164F, sets $FF1896 = 1, calls 0x002E1E, and sets $FF17BA = $FF."
    },
    {
      "name": "AI_Shade_State0E_FinishDarkHoleRecovery",
