      "description": "State $06 (0x0132AA..0x0133D0) zeroes Ali +$72/+$76; checks (+$40|+$41) bit 6 (wall -> 0x0133E6) and bit 7 (entity -> 0x01332A), then probes 0x013608 (on Carry clear & +$14 match: stores +$AA=a0, calls 0x013550, sets +$2A=4 & State $08); else decrements +$02 (-> State $08 +$2A=$12 on 0) and accelerates (0x80, 0x80) via 0x00E2D4 into +$4E/+$52 and +$72/+$76. Entity contact (0x01332A) latches +$37:7 grabbables matching +$14 via +$AA=a0 & 0x0134DE -> State $08, or strikes vulnerable enemies (+$38:3==0, +$82==0, +$83==0) with $FF184F=$5A, $FF1850=a0, +$7E=a6, +$86 = 1 + ($FF0DB8 >> 1) (plus big-endian high-byte bit 7 i.e. 0x8000 when +$10(a0) != 0), +$83=$0A, (0x500, 0x4C0) knockback, +$56=$28000, SFX #$700345 -> State $08 (+$2A=$12). State $08 (0x0133D0..0x01341A) calls 0x0134DE, zeroes Ali +$72/+$76, and on +$37 bit 1 enters State $0A (+$2A=6), negating +$4E/+$52, setting +$02 = 18 - +$02, and setting +$38:2."
